WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The CIA investigated a cat listening device beginning in 1964.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Working audio equipment could not guarantee a useful route.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A 1967 memo rejected the method as impractical.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The famous taxi ending is disputed. Separate the experiment from the legend.
